Z||000003||theogre||03-31-99||05:48 PM||||what codes are in the ECM? Did you pull out then reseat the prom? (remember to handle the prom by the carrier fram ONLY!) a dirty pin on the prom could cause all kinds of problems. <p>W? what connector is W? I can only find a-d+ 2 digit designations.<p>which motor is it? lack of power could be anything. vac leak, map flaky, batty TPS, etc. (I's replace the TPS if it even looks worn, those things wear alot internally.)
Z||000004||Don johnson||03-31-99||06:32 PM||||Code 51,And yes I did reseat the PROM.The (W) is for white/red and the(B) is for Black/blue.Those are the colors of the connectors to the ECM.Each connector is number 1-16.So far I have change out every sensor also the TPS.1988 2.5
